  "generated_text": "1. We need to find 10-digit positive integers where each digit is either 1 or 2.\n2. There digits must consecutive two consecutive 1's.\n\nLet's denote the 10-digit number as \\(a_1a_2a_3 \\_{1_{11}}1\n\n\nSince there must be two consecutive 1's, we can to the the1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111",
